<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Diệt Phát Xít (Nguyễn Đình Thi)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">written in answer to it, for the Viet Minh front</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Chiến Sĩ Việt Nam (Văn Cao)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">written in answer to Nguyễn Đình Thi's request</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Thăng Long (Văn Cao)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">earlier work its words and title were based on</span></li></ul></section>
